  "root": "Every ship part and anchor descends from the root; move, rotate or scale the root only.",
  "anchors": "Local +X is the effect axis (exhaust: aft for the main drives, down for the lift thrusters; line of fire); +Z as near hull-dorsal as that allows (toward the bow for a downward axis).",
  "turrets": "Rotate Turret <i> pivot about its local Z to train within its arc about the slot angle; the rest pose is the slot angle. The four flare launchers are fixed.",
  "engines": "Engines 1-6 are the main drives, 7-16 the lift thrusters (lift thruster 1-10); with the effects collection each has its own throttle, thr_throttle_e<i>.",
